     "titulo": "The date",
     "texto": [
      "Dates use numbers of Chinese origin and go from big to small: year (**년**), month (**월**), day (**일**).",
      "Months have no names: they are number + 월. 일월 (January), 이월 (February), 삼월 (March)… There are two that change a little: June is **유월** (not 육월) and October is **시월** (not 십월).",
      "**오월 십오 일** = 15 May.",
      "**오늘은 며칠이에요?** = What is today's date? **생일이 언제예요?** = When is your birthday?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
