    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The future: -(으)ㄹ 거예요",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about plans, add **-ㄹ 거예요** after a vowel or **ㄹ**, and **-을 거예요** after another consonant.",
      "하다 → **할 거예요**, 가다 → **갈 거예요**, 살다 → **살 거예요**, 먹다 → **먹을 거예요**.",
      "It is used for all people and also for questions: **뭐 할 거예요?** = What are you going to do?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Birthdays",
     "texto": [
      "**생일** = birthday. **생일 축하해요!** = Happy birthday!",
      "To talk about several people, add **들**: 친구 → **친구들** (friends). It is only used when it is needed to make it clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
